    shells = mgr.list_shells()              # Line 47: subprocess iteration
    mgr.terminate_shell(orphan.id)          # Line 51: process signaling
    rec = mgr.get_shell(shell_id)           # Line 57: file I/O
```

LAYER 2: WebSocket Handler Blocking (Lines 180-233)
```python
