LAYER 3: FrameworkShellManager Non-Thread-Safe Singleton
```python
# app/libs/framework_shells.py
class FrameworkShellManager:
    def __init__(...):
        self._lock = threading.RLock()  # Thread lock, not asyncio.Lock
        # Shared mutable state across all callers
        
    def list_shells(self):  # SYNCHRONOUS method
        with self._lock:    # Threading lock
