LOCATION: All locations using FrameworkShellManager

Find all calls to manager methods and add await:
  - ensure_app_running() may call mgr.spawn_shell() - make async
  - App lifecycle functions may call mgr.terminate_shell() - make async
  - Any mgr.list_shells() calls - add await
  - Any mgr.get_shell() calls - add await

Pattern:
```python
# OLD:
def ensure_app_running(app_id: str) -> dict:
    mgr = get_manager()
    shell = mgr.find_shell_by_label(f"app-worker:{app_id}", status="running")
    if not shell:
        shell = mgr.spawn_shell([...], label=f"app-worker:{app_id}")
    return {...}

# NEW:
async def ensure_app_running(app_id: str) -> dict:
    mgr = get_manager()
    shell = await mgr.find_shell_by_label(f"app-worker:{app_id}", status="running")
    if not shell:
        shell = await mgr.spawn_shell([...], label=f"app-worker:{app_id}")
    return {...}
```

Then update all callers of ensure_app_running to await it.

